  "details": "The current workflow for testing full body tracking is adjust the bones in Blender, adjust the bones in the meta rig, upload it to VRChat, and then finally get in your full full body tracking gear to test it.\n\nThere's a variety of problems that can be caused like the hip being oriented wrong, the legs being too short/long, or the floor being too high/low. None of this can be known without actually uploading and binding into the avatar in VRChat.\n\nIt would be nice to be able to test full body in the SDK with a variety of heights.",
